      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shevlin%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In its heyday, Shevlin boasted a cooperative creamery, saw mill, oil station, box factory, and three saloons, among other enterprises.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shevlin%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A history museum now occupies the old school building, preserving the town’s past.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
